name: sim.createCollection
description: Creates a new collection. A collection created in a simulation script, a customization script or in the main script are automatically destroyed when the script ends
luaSynopsis: int collectionHandle = sim.createCollection(int options)
pythonSynopsis: int collectionHandle = sim.createCollection(int options = 0)
inputs:
1. options: bit-coded options:
    - bit 0 set (1): collection overrides collidable, measurable, detectable properties, and also the visibility state of its objects.
outputs:
1. collectionHandle: handle of the new collection
